# Input graph for aminedouiri__knowledge-formalization-web-application__apps_visualisation_views.py__visualisation — written during translation.
# The region parses six real ontology files (viz_tache.ttl, viz_activite.ttl,
# viz_historique.ttl, viz_phenomene.ttl, viz_domaine.ttl, viz_strategie.ttl),
# one per SPARQL query it runs; here all six path parameters are pointed at
# this single fixture, which carries several instances of every class each
# query selects, a class with zero instances (Domaine — the zero-solution
# case), and neighbouring triples (a different class, a property assertion)
# that must not match any of the six patterns.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .

:t1 a :Tache .
:t2 a :Tache .

:a1 a :Activite .
:a2 a :Activite .
:a3 a :Activite .

:g1 a :Generation .

:p1 a :Phenomene_Metier .
:p2 a :Phenomene_Metier .

# :Domaine has zero instances on purpose: g_domaine.query(...) must yield
# no rows, and the translation's .first()-free SELECT must handle that the
# same way rdflib does — an empty iteration, not an error.

:s1 a :Strategie .
:s2 a :Strategie .

# neighbourhood that must not match any of the six patterns above
:x1 a :NotATrackedClass .
:t1 :relatedTo :a1 .
